    ['Ready to schedule','Arm a capture for the next full target window.'],
    ['Waiting for next pass','The flight software will check the camera and battery at the start of the pass.'],
    ['Capturing target','The solid arc shows the capture in progress.','active'],
    ['Pass complete','The green track shows where capture ran.','active'],
    ['Capture aborted','The orange track ends where the flight software stopped capture. See Mission events.','aborted'],
    ['Pass skipped','The flight software skipped this pass. See Mission events.']
